# SHA-256 of the executable loader the Bonsai 2 MLX pack ships in runtime/.
#
# scripts/mlx_generate_bonsai2.py and scripts/mlx_server_bonsai2.py both import that
# code, so a change to it is a change to what runs on the user's machine. These hashes
# are the reviewed revision: both scripts refuse to import anything that does not match.
#
# Re-pin after a deliberate runtime/ change, from the demo root:
#   shasum -a 256 models/Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-mlx-2bit/runtime/*.py
# and replace the lines below, keeping paths relative to runtime/.
